# sgo.build (schema: see the sgola tree's core/sgo.build). wataclient is the
# PORTABLE client core: a liblink library over core + json AND a publishable
# SGOLA-ONLY library (BUILD E2b): default package, no @goexport — its whole
# surface is consumed only from Sgola (wata-fb links it whole-program). `publish`
# makes `sgo emit <path>` produce its payload-only module tree (sgola/
# meta+tasty+src); consumers take it SOURCE-IN-LINK from pkg/mod via their
# go.mod require.
mode liblink
emitname wataclient
crosskey wataclient
optreport
publish
